name    crib
prog    crib -r
# Cribbage against the computer: the cut, and a hand dealt.  -r lets the
# program cut for you: a tied cut asks for the cut again, and a script that
# typed one answer to it stalled at the second prompt about one run in
# sixteen with no hand dealt.  With -r the program retries by itself.
rate    0.6
wait    6
key     n
key     \r
wait    3
key     S
wait    5
snap    hand
key     \003
wait    2
expect  +-----+
expect  Discard a card
